    {
      "abstract": "$\\rho^{0}/\\pi$ ratios as a function of c.m. system energy. The ratios are from measurements in $e^{+} e^{\u2212}$ collisions at $10.45$ GeV, $29$ GeV and $91$ GeV c.m. system energy, $p$+$p$ at $6.8$ GeV, $19.7$ GeV, $27.5$ GeV, and $52.5$ GeV, Kp at $7.82$ GeV and $\\pi^{-}$p at $19.6$ GeV. The errors on the ratios at $\\sqrt{s_{NN}}= 200$ GeV are the quadratic sum of the statistical and systematic errors. The ratios at $\\sqrt{s_{NN}}= 200$ GeV are offset from one another for clarity.",
